# Acme Corp Employee Handbook 2025
**Classification:** Internal
**Issued:** January 2025

---

## Welcome to Acme Corp

This handbook provides an overview of Acme Corp's employment policies, benefits, and workplace guidelines. It applies to all full-time and part-time employees.

## Code of Conduct

Acme Corp expects all employees to maintain the highest standards of professional conduct. Key principles:
- Treat all colleagues with respect and dignity
- Protect company confidential information
- Avoid conflicts of interest
- Report suspected misconduct to HR or Legal

## Benefits Summary

- Health insurance: Medical, dental, vision (employee + dependents)
- 401(k): 4% company match, vested over 3 years
- Paid time off: 15 days accrual in Year 1, increasing to 20 days after Year 3
- Parental leave: 12 weeks fully paid (primary carer), 4 weeks (secondary carer)
- Learning and development: $2,000 annual budget per employee

## Working Hours

Standard hours: 9am–5pm, Monday–Friday. Flexible work arrangements available with manager approval.

## Remote Work Policy

Employees may work remotely up to 3 days per week. Office attendance required for team meetings and quarterly reviews.

